# API Swagger

- `@nestjs/swagger` at `/api/docs` and `/api/docs-json`
- Tag every controller; `@ApiOperation`, `@ApiResponse`, DTOs with `@ApiProperty`
- Bearer + cookie auth schemes; document required permissions
- Production: `SWAGGER_ENABLED` flag
